Add amd_sof_acp7x_suspend() and amd_sof_acp7x_resume() for ACP7.B/7.F
platforms power management.

Signed-off-by: Vijendar Mukunda <Vijendar.Mukunda@amd.com>
Reviewed-by: Bard Liao <yung-chuan.liao@linux.intel.com>
---
